    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Mullayanagiri is frequently tested as the highest mountain peak in Karnataka.",
        "Distinguish between East-flowing (Krishna, Kaveri, Pennar) and West-flowing (Sharavathi, Kali, Netravathi) river systems.",
        "Questions often ask for the distinction between the wet Malnad region and dry Bayaluseeme (Maidan) region."
      ],
      "id": "wtppuwb"
